a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d28b1bc9-0d77-49da-aa08-d0d243f699f3</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d28b1bc9-0d77-49da-aa08-d0d243f699f3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d28b1bc9-0d77-49da-aa08-d0d243f699f3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-664&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-361</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\">Raise Dead</a>\n</p><p>Failed - Gone too long. Body decomposed. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Reanimation \n</p><p>Failed - Came back as ghoul. Had to kill again. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a>\n</p><p>Failed - Answers Unhelpful. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Clone \n</p><p>Failed - Needs living tissue. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Animating_Spores\" title=\"Animating Spores\">Reanimation</a> + Clone? \n</p><p>Failed - Had to kill both ghouls. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">Resurrection</a>\n</p><p>Failed - Why?! Magical curse? \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_True_Resurrection\" title=\"Scroll of True Resurrection\">True Resurrection</a>\n</p><p>I have reached the limit of my skills and resources. The book offers help. Dare I accept?\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215901\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1670/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29860/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8033/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930696/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.155      1 -total\n 98.23%   43.374      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 55.93%   24.694      7 Template:Icon_text\n 50.06%   22.106     17 Template:Trim\n 23.45%   10.354      2 Template:Uid\n 15.16%    6.693      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.39%    5.914      2 Template:Icon_link\n 13.29%    5.870      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.70%    4.724      1 Template:Notes\n 10.42%    4.600      7 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12629-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215901 and revision id 281270. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}